# changes-requested/reviewable-again-body-edit — the decision table (family contract in
# fixture.yaml). The axis is the activity after a CHANGES_REQUESTED review. Each row has its own
# world (gh/pr-list.json + gh/pr-view-*.json) under rows/<id>/. THE FIXED ROW is body-edit-only:
# red on base (old .updatedAt predicate fails to distinguish from comment-only), green after (new
# .bodyLastEditedAt predicate works).
#
# id                    | world | patch | env | expect                | params
body-edit-only          |       |       |     | body-edit-only        |
new-commit              |       |       |     | new-commit            |
comment-only            |       |       |     | comment-only          |
review-submission-only  |       |       |     | review-submission-only |
nothing-since-review    |       |       |     | nothing-since-review  |
